NOTES ON DATA AND THIRD-PARTY SERVICES

Dataset. Everything under `database/data/dhansetu_v1_2/` is SYNTHETIC, generated
by the scripts in that directory from a fixed seed. It describes no real person,
enterprise or financial account. The six named personas and all credentials
documented in `database/README.md` are fictional test fixtures. The synthetic
dataset is released under the same MIT terms as the code.

Real data layers. Live weather comes from Open-Meteo (CC BY 4.0), mandi price
mappings reference Agmarknet (Government of India, data.gov.in), and map tiles
come from the Google Maps Static API. Those services are used under their own
terms, which this licence does not extend or alter.

Third-party components. The applications depend on open-source packages under
their own licences (MIT, Apache-2.0, BSD and others) as declared in each
project's `package.json` / `requirements.txt`. Speech-to-text and language
model inference use Sarvam AI under its API terms; machine translation uses
Google's public translation endpoint.

Not a financial product. This is a hackathon prototype. Nothing in it is a
credit decision, a lending offer, or regulated financial advice.
